  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110020,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ぜ、全然\r\n映ってませんでしたね……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040220030",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110030,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "最初の、ペーパーテスト上位のところで\r\n抜かれたくらいで……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……そうだな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110040,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "せっかく出られたのに……\r\n全然、爪痕残せてませんね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110040"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "い、いやでもさ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0327"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "地上波の番組で『ノクチルの福丸小糸』って\r\n紹介されるだけでも、すごいことだぞ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110050,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そ、そうですけど……\r\n本当に、一瞬だったし",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110060,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "多分見てた人ほとんど覚えてないんじゃ……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "う…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110070,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……ペーパーテストから出演した人で\r\n珍回答を出してる人も、難問を答えてる人もいましたから",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110080,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "わたしは、どっちもできずじまいで……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうのは、難しいよな\r\nただ知識があればいいってだけじゃないだろうし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110090,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "早押しなんて、\r\n押せすらしませんでした……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか\r\nそういう対策も、必要だったな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110100,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ああいうところに立つと、簡単な問題も\r\n全然わからなくなったりして……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110110,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "やっぱり、ただの試験とは違いますね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110120,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……小糸、あのさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今回はまず、出演できたこと自体が\r\n本当にすごいことだよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その点で、もっと自信を持っていいし\r\n自分を褒めてあげてもらいたい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん俺からもすごいって気持ちを伝えたいし、\r\n……あまり落ち込んだりしなくても──……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110130,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "────わたし",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110140,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……結果は残せませんでしたけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110150,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "だけど、この番組のために努力したことは\r\nひとつも無駄じゃなかったと思います",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110160,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "勉強しなきゃとか、やらなきゃって\r\nそういうふうに思ってた時と今回って",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110170,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "やってることはほとんど変わってなくて",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確かに\r\nそうかもしれないな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110180,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……だから、今までそうやって追われるようにでも\r\n積み重ねてきたことって",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110190,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ちゃんと、わたしのやりたいことに\r\n繋がってたんだって思うんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110200,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "お母さんとか、先生とかが『こうしなさい』\r\n『ああしなさい』って言ってくれてたことって",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110210,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ちゃんと、わたしのためだったんだなって……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "………………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110220,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "だけど、そういうふうに思えるようになったのは\r\nプロデューサーさんのおかげだと思います",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え……！\r\nお、俺か……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110230,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "はい……！\r\nだって",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110240,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "わたしが何をしたいのか\r\nいつもそれを、一番に考えてくれるから",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは……そうだよ\r\nそれが、一番大事だと思ってるからさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110250,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……そうですよね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110260,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110270,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "勉強してきたことしか、\r\nきっと試験では答えられません",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110280,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "だから色んなことを勉強して、積み重ねて\r\n試験だけじゃなくて",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110290,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ちょっとずつだけど、色んなことができるように\r\nできることを、精一杯やってやるぞーって",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110290"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006110300,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "すごく、前向きなんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200611/2022006110300"
  },
